  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building Workshop for PROCMURA stakeholders in Bamako, Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention will strengthen PROCMURAs organisational pressence in Mali and build the capacity of the churches and the community in interfaith relations and dialogue. It will build the capacity of the Church in Mali for Christian-Muslim relations, which is vital in today&apos;s religiously pluralistic environment and specifically for Mali where the majority of the population is Muslim. PROCMURA will establish a PROCMURA Area Committee in the country. This is a structured need for better service delivery for PROCMURA&#x2019;s projects for Christian Muslim relations and Freedom of Religion and Belief in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
